  "content": "# 第26题\n\n**题型**: 选择题\n\n**难度**: ★★☆☆☆\n\n**分值**: 2分\n\n---\n\n## 题目内容\n\nAccording to the author, the project with the robotics professor was ________.\n\n## 选项\n\nA. A. demanding\n\nB. B. inspiring\n\nC. C. misleading\n\nD. D. amusing\n\n---\n\n## 参考答案\n\nB\n\n",
  "answer": "C",
  "analysis": "本题考查非谓语动词。主语‘The book’与write之间为被动关系，且表示‘被写的那本书’，用过去分词作定语，故选C。"
